| Load smoke tests | `go test -run TestLoadSmoke ./...` | `scripts/verify.sh`, CI | Every push and PR |
| Chaos tests for Dokploy timeouts | `go test -run TestChaosDokployTimeouts ./...` | `scripts/verify.sh`, CI | Every push and PR |
