| Idempotency replay tests | `go test -run TestIdempotencyReplay ./...` | `scripts/verify.sh`, CI | Every push and PR |
| Audit completeness tests | `go test -run TestAuditCompleteness ./...` | `scripts/verify.sh`, CI | Every push and PR |
